After finding a '''Glacite Mineshaft''', a portal will appear, which the player has 30 seconds to enter before it disappears. A sound will be played and the following chat message will appear:

{{Gamefont|{{cyan|Mineshaft!}} A mineshaft portal spawned nearby!}}

A notification will also appear in the middle of the screen with the same wording as the chat message. Once the portal appears, it will emit {{purple|purple}} and white particles. Above the particles, the player's name will appear next to {{Green|Mineshaft Portal}}. Once you click the portal, a UI will appear with more info:

{{:Glacite Mineshafts/UI}}

