== Tips ==
* It is recommended to enter the '''Glacite Tunnels''' after reaching {{Coll|Heart of the Mountain VIII}}, as the lowest new gemstones have {{Stat|BP|9}} and a [[Block Strength]] of {{Green|5200}}, while the newest [[Dwarven Metals]] have {{Statname|9 Breaking Power}} and a block strength of {{Green|5,600}}.
**As such, the recommended stats and gear are {{Stat|ms|3750}}, {{Item|Armor of Divan}}, a {{Item|Silverfish Pet}}, and a {{Item|Titanium Drill DR-X555}} or better.
*{{Glacite Powder}} from tiers {{Green|8}}-{{Green|10}} can be used to get {{AN|Warm Hearted}} and {{AN|Strong Arm}} to stay in the '''Glacite Tunnels and Glacite Mineshafts''' for longer and mine {{Item|Umber}}, {{Item|Tungsten}}, and {{Item|Glacite}} quicker, respectively.
**Additionally, {{AN|Eager Adventurer}}, {{AN|Metal Head}}, and {{AN|Rags to Riches}} can help with mining in the [[Glacite Mineshafts]].
**{{AN|Crystalline}} may be useful if the player needs [[Gemstone Crystals]] to forge {{Item|Rough Onyx Gemstone|text=Onyx}}, {{Item|Rough Citrine Gemstone|text=Citrine}}, {{Item|Rough Peridot Gemstone|text=Peridot}}, {{Item|Rough Aquamarine Gemstone|text=Aquamarine}}, or {{Item|Rough Opal Gemstone|text=Opal}} [[Gemstone|Perfect Gemstones]].

